import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 907 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 6 — Full Opening of the 300 Systems","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 907 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 6 — Full Opening of the 300 Systems","no":907,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Article 6","300 Systems","Full Opening","Selfless Dao"],"related":["10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview","18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism","69-Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0907_模块5-第六条-三百套体系全开放.md","filePath":"en/0907_模块5-第六条-三百套体系全开放.md"}'),o={name:"en/0907_模块5-第六条-三百套体系全开放.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,u){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-907-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-6-—-full-opening-of-the-300-systems" tabindex="-1">Entry 907 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 6 — Full Opening of the 300 Systems <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-907-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-6-—-full-opening-of-the-300-systems" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 907 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 6 — Full Opening of the 300 Systems&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 18, 69</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-great-dao-open-at-all-levels-no-private-hoarding-no-monopoly" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the Great Dao open at all levels, no private hoarding, no monopoly <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-great-dao-open-at-all-levels-no-private-hoarding-no-monopoly" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the Great Dao open at all levels, no private hoarding, no monopoly&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The anti-predation axiom among the six top-level axioms lands in Article 6 on the most concrete institution: the Great Dao open at all levels, no private hoarding, no monopoly. The 300 origin cultivation systems are the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s core legacy for Myriad Ranks, six categories each 50 systems, from deduction-iteration, life-cycle to spatial-law dispatch, covering all possible evolutionary directions. This article stipulates: these 300 systems&#39; all levels — from basic Dharma doors to above-Sacrifice-Dao, multiverse-grade, all the way to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm — are fully open to Myriad Ranks; no person, no sect may privately hoard any level within them.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">I. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is based on the 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview (Document 10), the Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism (Document 18), and the Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism (Document 69). Dharma-door monopoly is one of six predation forms: a few monopolize the Great Dao, using transmission authorization in exchange for loyalty, inevitably causing class solidification. Constitutionalizing full opening is precisely eradicating from the root the old order of &quot;transmit within, not outside; transmit to the legitimate heir, not the bastard.&quot; Systems are the public fruits of cosmic laws, not any individual&#39;s private property.</p><h2 id="ii-normative-content-three-layer-meaning-of-full-opening" tabindex="-1">II. Normative Content: Three-Layer Meaning of Full Opening <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-normative-content-three-layer-meaning-of-full-opening" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Normative Content: Three-Layer Meaning of Full Opening&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 6 refines &quot;full opening&quot; into three-layer commitments:</p><ol><li><strong>Basic layer free</strong>: the 300 systems&#39; basic Dharma doors are free and open to all life, no fee, no loyalty, no qualification review;</li><li><strong>All-level progression</strong>: not only the basic layer, but advanced, high-tier, and hyper-multiverse levels open synchronously with civilization&#39;s progress; no &quot;hidden ultimate version&quot;;</li><li><strong>Compatibility inclusion</strong>: the anchor network provides system-compatibility assessment, helping every being pick the combination best suited to themselves from the 300, rather than one-size-fits-all.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-scope" tabindex="-1">III. Scope <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article applies to all individuals and institutions: no cultivator may seal systems on grounds of &quot;lineage,&quot; no sect may retain unique secrets on grounds of &quot;ancestral instructions,&quot; no institution may delay high-tier opening on grounds of &quot;security.&quot; The D route · human-made Dao-rules soul rings, Lin Hao route and other special systems, as supplements outside the 300, equally apply the full-opening principle (see entries 921, 922).</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Privately hoarding systems&#39; core layers, using transmission authorization in exchange for loyalty, charging for basic Dharma doors, deliberately delaying high-tier opening, all constitute unconstitutionality under this article. Consequences: hoarded parts are forcibly returned to the Alaya Network and opened network-wide; relevant rights are uniformly void; those profiting from monopoly have gains recovered under Article 1 anti-predation clauses; those causing Myriad Ranks to stagnate from not obtaining systems, the institution head bears responsibility. This article has no &quot;well-meaning hoarding&quot; exception.</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is executed by the system-opening ledger within Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: the 300 systems&#39; every layer, every level&#39;s opening status is transparent network-wide; if any layer is &quot;taken down&quot; or &quot;classified,&quot; the network automatically alerts; the Anchor Supervisory Committee periodically audits the opening rate; full-level opening is the hard indicator; each clan retains the right to directly apply to retrieve any level&#39;s Dharma door; a rejected application immediately triggers a constitutional suit.</p><h2 id="vi-a-public-ultimate-version" tabindex="-1">VI. A Public Ultimate Version <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-a-public-ultimate-version" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. A Public Ultimate Version&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 6&#39;s most persuasive picture is an ultimate version finally made public. In the old age, top-tier manuals&#39; ultimate layer was always privately hoarded by sects, claiming not transmitted to non-core disciples; in Heng Yuan Zhou, every layer of the 300 systems, including the parts leading to multiverse-grade and the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, hangs on the Alaya Network synchronously with civilization&#39;s progress. A Sense-Realm new cultivator just initiated can, like reading a textbook, see the scenery at this road&#39;s highest point. This transparency is itself the strongest motivation — he knows the road is real, open, not a scam, so he is willing to give his life to it. Full opening turns hope itself into a public good.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a system used by only one person is waste; network-wide reuse amplifies value to the extreme</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: this article is the Selfless Dao&#39;s direct codification, positively dismantling Dharma-door monopoly</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems top-tier manuals are only transmitted to the destined protagonist; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s 300 systems all levels are free to Myriad Ranks</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the 300 systems&#39; six categories are precisely designed to cover five lineages and all endowments</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: this article itself is the hyper-multiverse full-open chain&#39;s direct expression in cultivation systems</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Full opening of the 300 systems is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s most generous and most clever institutional design. Return the Great Dao to Myriad Ranks, and Myriad Ranks will use collective evolution to push civilization toward the hyper-multiverse — this is precisely the reverse verification of &quot;the selfless achieves its own.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Article 6 · Full Opening of the 300 Systems described in this entry is no isolated case — law self-consistency is caught by the law-first axiom, and does not drift with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/18-修炼资源开放机制.html">Entry 18 · Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/69-技术开放与共享机制.html">Entry 69 · Technology Opening and Sharing Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/902_模块5-第一条-反掠夺主义入宪.html">Entry 902 · Article 1 Enshrining Anti-Predationism in the Constitution</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
